Description:
 baul-extensions-common - Baul extensions (common files)
 baul-image-converter - Baul extension to mass resize or rotate images
 baul-open-terminal - Baul plugin for opening terminals in arbitrary local paths
 baul-sendto - integrates email clients and Pidgin into the Baul file manager
 baul-share - Allows one to quickly share a folder from the Baul file manager
 baul-wallpaper - Allows one to quickly set a wallpaper from folders
 baul-xattr-tags - Allows one to view extended attributes
Changes:
 baul-extensions (2.1.0-1) unstable; urgency=medium
 .
   * New upstream release
